    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Predictive Convergence Map.</strong> You can sketch a route that passes through where the plot <em>will</em> be, not just where it is.</p><ul><li>When you plan a <strong>Travel route</strong> with an eye toward encountering (or avoiding) Sparks, Tikkun events, or specific factions, you gain a small mechanical edge on <strong>Travel planning checks</strong> (Athletics (Violence), relevant Bad Eden travel skills, or your Travel Console abstractions).</li><li>On a success, the GM may shift the encounter tables or event probabilities slightly in your favor: making desired events more likely and unwanted ones slightly less likely.</li></ul>",
